    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Possible Future</strong> is an adult visual novel that explores a path humanity and AI could take: a sci-fi world in which humans want for nothing, and their every need is met by robot caretakers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272320/extras/a57a1d03ab07365dc4912d1d1f2f7428.avif?t=1744585713\" width=600 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the future as a young woman who lives alone with her cat. Gardens, shopping districts, and new friends await in the labyrinthine halls of a planet-sized city.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet your robot caretakers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your neighborhood and the surrounding area</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibe to an all-original synth soundtrack</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272320/extras/6a9a06ab7c02e37e5b84f7e689a9f638.avif?t=1744585713\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumors circulate among the city's human inhabitants - rumors of unseen places, and secret rendezvous. How far will your curiosity take you?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read between the lines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles with the help of your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a <i>real</i> window</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272320/extras/20695c61f13ffaaa5b665b23317e39eb.avif?t=1744585713\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn on your favorite Bluetooth-enabled toy to make the most of the experience as you meet - and have fun with - the city's robot citizens ;)</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uses Intiface Central to support dozens of toys from many manufacturers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four robots and two humans to meet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li></ul>",
